Readline: line editing and history of the interactive CLI (php56 -a),
with GNU readline of the package az.

The module readline of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/readline.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/readline.
